@HostAddress = http://localhost:5281
@Version = v1

### 1. Obtain a JWT token (the token is captured and reused by the requests below)
# @name login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "demo-password"
}

### 2. Aggregated data for a city (all APIs, newest first)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/aggregation?city=Athens
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Weather only, next 3 days, ordered by date ascending
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/aggregation?city=Thessaloniki&category=Weather&from=2026-11-21&to=2026-11-24&sortBy=date&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. News + repositories about a topic, ordered by relevance, page 2
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/aggregation?city=Athens&topic=dotnet&sources=HackerNews,GitHub&sortBy=relevance&page=2&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Text search inside the aggregated items
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/aggregation?city=London&search=rain
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Validation error (missing city, invalid sortBy) -> 400
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/aggregation?sortBy=popularity
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Request statistics per external API
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Without a token -> 401
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/{{Version}}/statistics
Accept: application/json

### 9. Health
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
